{
  "$comment": [
    "PROVENANCE — READ THIS BEFORE TRUSTING ANYTHING BELOW.",
    "",
    "These are NOT captured from a Microsoft 365 tenant. They are hand-built to the shape of the",
    "Microsoft Graph `event` resource as Microsoft documents it, using the field names, casing and",
    "value formats from that published schema. Capturing real payloads needs a credential AND an",
    "Exchange Application Access Policy scoping app-only Calendars.Read, and that policy is still",
    "unconfirmed — which is exactly why a replayed fixture exists at all.",
    "",
    "WHAT THAT MEANS FOR ANY DEMO USING THEM. The engine, MapGraphEvent, participant resolution,",
    "threading through seriesMasterId, the watermark and the write path are all exercised for real.",
    "What is NOT proven is that Microsoft returns exactly these shapes for these fields. The first",
    "live run is still the first live run, and the honest thing is to say so rather than let a green",
    "demo imply otherwise.",
    "",
    "Every address is on example.com / example.org, which RFC 2606 reserves precisely so sample data",
    "cannot reach a real mailbox.",
    "",
    "Fields present here that MapGraphEvent does NOT read (categories, changeKey, importance,",
    "sensitivity, showAs, type, responseStatus, isOrganizer, responseRequested, reminderMinutesBeforeStart,",
    "isReminderOn, onlineMeeting*, webLink, originalStartTimeZone, allowNewTimeProposals, hideAttendees,",
    "locations, recurrence) are kept deliberately: a real Graph response carries them, and stripping",
    "them would make the fixture agree with our mapper rather than with Microsoft. NormalizedItem.Raw",
    "preserves the whole payload, so they belong here.",
    "",
    "WHAT EACH EVENT IS FOR — the set is chosen to exercise decisions, not to look tidy:",
    "  1 evt-ext-1   an ordinary external meeting; the plain mapping path",
    "  2 evt-occ-2   type=occurrence with a seriesMasterId; proves a recurring instance threads to",
    "                its series and carries its OWN start, not the series' start",
    "  3 evt-cancel  isCancelled=true; MapGraphEvent must carry Cancelled through rather than drop it",
    "  4 evt-int-4   organizer and every attendee internal; the ParticipantScope=HasExternal case that",
    "                must be EXCLUDED once InternalDomains names example.com",
    "  5 evt-tz-5    a named non-UTC timeZone with no offset in the string. Graph sends naive local",
    "                time plus a separate zone, and without a tz database that does not determine an",
    "                instant. The mapper must SKIP this and say so, never guess — a guess files the",
    "                meeting hours from when it happened.",
    "  6 evt-att-6   hasAttachments=true; the only event whose rule would trigger an attachment fetch"
  ],
